// handlePreviewPackagingRequest handles previewPackaging operation.
//
// Runs the checks the packaging call runs, so a preview that says yes and a packaging that refuses
// cannot both happen. Same relationship GET /suggestions/{id}/diff has with the apply call, and for
// the same reason: two sets of criteria drift, and the drift always favours the step the user most
// wants to succeed.
